From dc0d195fc5b7749801e5552391533ff636b83680 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 01:20:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Preserve cross-gateway priority donation after
 pickup

Pickup ranks the full replica but dispatch previously ranked only its imported subset, dropping priorities donated by remote waiters. Overlay the read-only graph with local rows and child-edge authority; preserve admission, review reservation and stored priorities. Replica faults fall back to local dispatch.

Proof: raw foreign900/local100 control passes on baseline; inherited900 foreign0/local100 fails before and passes after. Canonical focused suites: 143 tests; 10 behavioral mutants killed. Read-only hub graph replay: 4582 tasks, 1953 edges, 65 ready candidates in 17ms; no writes.
